WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.579 --> 00:00:15.680
left the palace?"

2
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:16.940
Gildong said.

3
00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:20.841
He stared at the princess, looking worried.

4
00:00:20.861 --> 00:00:23.982
"You had better go back," he said.

5
00:00:24.002 --> 00:00:29.123
"When your servants learn that you are missing "I know."

6
00:00:29.704 --> 00:00:30.964
The princess nodded.

7
00:00:31.976 --> 00:00:32.997
"I must get back.

8
00:00:33.317 --> 00:00:34.918
But I do not know the way."

9
00:00:34.938 --> 00:00:38.159
"I do," said Gildong.

10
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.761
"Please follow me, Your Highness."

11
00:00:42.142 --> 00:00:46.944
The children walked for a while and soon they could see the palace walls.

12
00:00:46.964 --> 00:00:50.446
"Wow!" Vinnie whispered.

13
00:00:51.887 --> 00:00:55.028
The princess stopped and looked at her new friends.

14
00:00:55.709 --> 00:00:57.590
"Would you like to come inside?"

15
00:00:58.290 --> 00:00:58.870
she asked.

16
00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:01.552
"Yes!" cried Vinnie.

17
00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.262
"But we are not royalty, Your Highness," Gildong reminded her.

18
00:01:06.282 --> 00:01:08.584
"This is not allowed."

19
00:01:08.604 --> 00:01:13.406
"You are my friends," said the princess firmly.

20
00:01:13.426 --> 00:01:15.808
"So you are welcome here.

21
00:01:16.968 --> 00:01:19.670
But there are guards everywhere," she added.

22
00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:22.912
"We must be careful that you are not seen."

23
00:01:24.372 --> 00:01:25.933
They followed the princess.

24
00:01:25.953 --> 00:01:30.336
"You can enter there," she said, pointing to the gate.

25
00:01:31.504 --> 00:01:32.845
"I will distract the guards."

26
00:01:34.065 --> 00:01:37.987
The princess went over to the guards and began talking to them.

27
00:01:39.348 --> 00:01:42.869
When the guards turned around, Mandy slipped through the gate.

28
00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:46.491
Vinnie was next, followed by Gildong.

29
00:01:47.531 --> 00:01:50.433
A moment later the princess joined them.

30
00:01:50.453 --> 00:01:53.034
"Welcome to the palace!"

31
00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:54.774
she said happily.

32
00:01:54.794 --> 00:01:57.896
"I will show you around."

33
00:01:59.188 --> 00:02:01.250
They walked past a long wall.

34
00:02:02.171 --> 00:02:06.614
Gildong stopped to look at a grand building with two roofs.

35
00:02:07.855 --> 00:02:11.098
"That building must be very important," he said.

36
00:02:11.118 --> 00:02:14.181
"Yes," the princess said.

37
00:02:14.201 --> 00:02:16.402
"That's the throne hall.

38
00:02:17.463 --> 00:02:19.485
My father met with noblemen there."

39
00:02:19.505 --> 00:02:23.248
"Is your father the king of Korea?"

40
00:02:23.688 --> 00:02:24.469
asked Mandy.

41
00:02:24.489 --> 00:02:31.769
"No, not anymore The princess looked away as they walked on.

42
00:02:31.789 --> 00:02:36.570
"He died not long ago, and now there is a new king."

43
00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.411
"How sad murmured Mandy.

44
00:02:40.432 --> 00:02:45.593
"Yes," the princess said with a sigh.

45
00:02:45.613 --> 00:02:51.215
"But my father, King Sejong, did many wonderful things for our people.

46
00:02:52.295 --> 00:02:55.276
During his time there were lots of new inventions."

47
00:02:56.432 --> 00:02:59.295
She stopped beside something on the ground.

48
00:02:59.315 --> 00:03:02.757
"For example, this is a rain gauge.

49
00:03:03.698 --> 00:03:05.460
It was invented by scientists.

50
00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:07.381
They worked for my father."

51
00:03:07.401 --> 00:03:09.723
"What does it do?"

52
00:03:10.224 --> 00:03:10.964
asked Mandy.

53
00:03:10.984 --> 00:03:13.806
"It measures how much rain falls.

54
00:03:14.887 --> 00:03:17.850
People can tell if the harvest will be good or bad."

55
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:20.812
They continued walking.

56
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:25.116
Then Vinnie spotted something shaped like a bowl.

57
00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:27.081
"What is that?"

58
00:03:27.101 --> 00:03:29.062
"A sundial.

59
00:03:29.923 --> 00:03:34.526
The famous scientist Jang Youngsil invented that type of sundial.

60
00:03:35.567 --> 00:03:38.349
It works like a clock," the princess said.

61
00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:41.651
Mandy studied the sundial.

62
00:03:41.671 --> 00:03:44.253
"What time is it now?"

63
00:03:44.673 --> 00:03:45.994
she asked the princess.

64
00:03:46.014 --> 00:03:50.177
"It is The princess bent closer.

65
00:03:50.197 --> 00:03:52.279
"Oh no!"

66
00:03:52.759 --> 00:03:53.540
She gasped.

67
00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:56.273
"It is time to go back to my room!"
